      "_id": "testimonial-4",
      "_rev": "kqd32DnwMDSkqBnWPtbPOH",
      "_type": "testimonial",
      "_updatedAt": "2026-07-24T09:40:32Z",
      "author": "Gebriel Kassahun",
      "location": "Addis Ababa",
      "quote": "Teaching የማዕድ ስነ-ስርዓት (Dining Etiquette), positive communication (ፈገግታና አዎንታዊ ተግባቦት), and self-defense ensures our students grow into respectful, well-rounded leaders.",
      "role": "Core Instructor & Life Skills Lead",
      "track": "Hospitality & Life Skills"
    },
    {
